BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserFirstIntro: @ 82501C1
	.string "斯宾塞：我的肉体永远\n"
	.string "与宝可梦同在！\p"
	.string "我的心永远与\n"
	.string "宝可梦一同跳动！\p"
	.string "训练家中的少年啊！\n"
	.string "你相信你的宝可梦吗？\p"
	.string "你能彻底地相信它们吗？\n"
	.string "若你的信任之情脆弱，\p"
	.string "就永远胜不过我的同胞！$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_ProveYourBondWithMons: @ 82502C4
	.string "你与宝可梦之间的羁绊！\n"
	.string "就在这里证明给我看！$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserPostSilverBattle: @ 82502FF
	.string "斯宾塞：哇哈哈哈！\n"
	.string "哈，你根本没上我的当！\p"
	.string "抱歉耍了那种花招！\n"
	.string "来！\p"
	.string "把那东西拿来！$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_LetsSeeFrontierPass: @ 825036D
	.string "哎呀呀，你要是能一直\n"
	.string "保持那副威严气派就好了……\p"
	.string "来！\n"
	.string "让我看看你的开拓通行证！$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedSpiritsSymbol: @ 82503DC
	.string "灵魂象征被印在了\n"
	.string "开拓通行证上！$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserAwaitNextTime: @ 8250412
	.string "斯宾塞：你宝可梦的眼神\n"
	.string "真是清澈无云。\p"
	.string "我会热切期待下一次\n"
	.string "与你相见的机会。$"

BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceBattleRoom_Text_SpenserThisTimeWontHoldBack: @ 8250485
	.string "斯宾塞：哇哈哈哈！\n"
	.string "你又一路打上来了？\p"
	.string "你一定与宝可梦建立了\n"
	.string "真正牢固的羁绊。\p"
	.string "那就这样吧！\n"
	.string "这次我不虚张声势，也不留情。\p"
	.string "这次可不闹着玩了。\n"
	.string "准备好了吗？\p"
	.string "准备输吧！$"

